# Names tools/nsdns.py answers for a namespaced console, one per line.
# Re-read on every query, so editing this needs no restart and no root.
#
# This list must mirror the demonware block in the HOST's /etc/hosts, so a
# namespaced console resolves exactly what console 1 resolves. The game looks
# up the STUN names FIRST and gives up with "Unable to connect to WormNet."
# without ever asking for the auth server if they come back NXDOMAIN -- so
# leaving them out here stalls sign-in before a single packet is sent.
worms-180.auth.mmp3.demonware.net
worms-180.lsg.mmp3.demonware.net
stun.us.demonware.net
stun.eu.demonware.net
stun.jp.demonware.net
stun.au.demonware.net
worms.stun.us.demonware.net
worms.stun.eu.demonware.net
